[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojojames/fzfa/pulls/16","id":4424023888,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSW482s8AAAABB7E_UA","html_url":"https://github.com/jojojames/fzfa/pull/16","diff_url":"https://github.com/jojojames/fzfa/pull/16.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/jojojames/fzfa/pull/16.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojojames/fzfa/issues/16","number":16,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix: discard stale native request results","user":{"login":"dangduc","id":950627,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MDYyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/950627?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc","html_url":"https://github.com/dangduc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What this changes\n\nThis PR gives each native scoring request a local request token. A result may\nchange source state only while that token, native request ID, and source handle\nstill belong to the same request.\n\nIt applies the check to request submission, status reads, failure reporting,\nand snapshot publication.\n\n## Why\n\nNative scoring finishes later. While it is running, the user may type a new\nquery or the source may restart. The old native call can still return after the\nnew request has become current.\n\nChecking only the native request ID is not enough. An ID may be reused. The\nlocal token separates the old lifetime from the new lifetime.\n\n## Examples\n\n1. The user types `a`, then quickly types `ab`.\n\n   The `a` request finishes last. Its token is old, so fzfa drops its result.\n   The `ab` candidates stay current.\n\n2. A source restarts while a snapshot is being copied into Lisp.\n\n   The snapshot call returns, but the source now owns another handle. Fzfa does\n   not store the old candidates on the new source.\n\n3. The native layer reuses request ID `17`.\n\n   The first request with ID `17` has token 4. The later request with the same\n   ID has token 5. A late result from token 4 is rejected.\n\n4. An old request reports a failure after a new request starts.\n\n   Fzfa checks ownership before showing the message. The old failure does not\n   get reported as if it belonged to the new query.\n\n5. Native submission refuses a request.\n\n   Fzfa clears the local ownership record. A result from an earlier request\n   cannot use the refused request's empty slot.\n\n## Scope\n\nThis PR protects native request results. It does not yet protect frontend\ntimers, Helm hooks, teardown, or display-generation acknowledgement. Those are\nthe next three PRs.\n\n## Stack\n\n1 of 4. All four PRs target `main` and should merge in order.\n\n1. This PR: native request publication\n2. Frontend callback ownership\n3. Revoke-first teardown and startup rollback\n4. Commit native generations after display\n\n## Verification\n\n- Local fzf-native 2.7: 256 tests passed, 0 unexpected.\n- Byte compilation treats warnings as errors as part of `make test`.\n- [CI](https://github.com/jojojames/fzfa/actions/runs/33650850161): 6/6 jobs\n  passed on Ubuntu, macOS, and Windows with Emacs 30.1 and snapshot. Windows\n  checked the fzf-native 2.7 batch-only fallback against the tracked artifact\n  and a clean source build. This stack does not add fzf-native 2.2 support.\n","created_at":"2026-09-02T15:47:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-02T15:56:21Z","closed_at":"2026-09-02T15:56:21Z","merged_at":"2026-09-02T15:56:21Z","merge_commit_sha":"f28e18d432e74507f7520c43c076b2f53122248c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojojames/fzfa/pulls/16/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojojames/fzfa/pulls/16/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojojames/fzfa/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojojames/fzfa/issues/16/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojojames/fzfa/statuses/5c9e6c61328010e7168b18cbff5f75a9e95080e2","head":{"label":"dangduc:codex/minimal-request-publication","ref":"codex/minimal-request-publication","sha":"5c9e6c61328010e7168b18cbff5f75a9e95080e2","user":{"login":"dangduc","id":950627,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MDYyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/950627?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc","html_url":"https://github.com/dangduc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dangduc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1343196639,"node_id":"R_kgDOUA-N3w","name":"fzfa","full_name":"dangduc/fzfa","private":false,"owner":{"login":"dangduc","id":950627,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MDYyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/950627?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url"